{"id":"passendale","name":"Passendale","qid":"Q255575","country":"Belgium","locality":"Zonnebeke","lat":"50.900277777","lon":"3.020555555","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Date not recorded","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"","type":"municipality section","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Passendale","text":"Passendale (Dutch: [ˈpɑsənˌdaːlə]) or Passchendaele (English: PASH-ən-dayl, French: [pasœndal]; West Flemish: Passchendoale) is a rural Belgian village in the Zonnebeke municipality of West Flanders province. It is close to the town of Ypres, situated on the hill ridge separating the historical wetlands of the Yser and Leie valleys. It is also commonly known as a battlefield and the name of a campaign during World War I, the Battle of Passchendaele.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Passendale","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-c38695a41a7d","w":1200,"h":900,"title":"Passendale - Sint-Audomaruskerk 1.jpg","o":"gh-c38695a41a7d.jpg","credit":{"text":"LimoWreck","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Passendale_-_Sint-Audomaruskerk_1.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"battlefield-1--battlefield-1-passchendaele","game":"battlefield-1","name":"Battlefield 1 Passchendaele","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-pa10cd943650","w":1200,"h":675,"o":"gh-pa10cd943650.jpg","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:Battlefield_1_Passchendaele.jpg","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Lamicrosz on 2018-02-28"}}]},{"id":"battlefield-1--passchendaele","game":"battlefield-1","name":"Passchendaele","verified":false,"text":"Passchendaele Passchendaele is a map featured in the Battlefield 1: Apocalypse expansion. It is a remake of the prologue of the si